            {
              "text": "One of three ranks holds every Hajj act",
              "size": "hook",
              "at": 0.0,
              "until": 3.86
            },
            {
              "text": "Hajj is once in a life, in Dhul Hijjah",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 4.2,
              "until": 8.04
            },
            {
              "text": "A pillar: leave it and there is no Hajj",
              "sub": "money cannot buy a pillar back",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 8.38,
              "until": 14.66
            },
            {
              "text": "An obligation: a sacrifice repairs it",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 15.0,
              "until": 18.63
            },
            {
              "text": "A sunnah: better, and nothing is owed",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 18.97,
              "until": 22.65
            },
            {
              "text": "Only Arafah has no way back at all",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 22.99,
              "until": 26.52
            },
            {
              "text": "The schools do not rank every act the same",
              "sub": "sa'i: a pillar for three, a duty for Hanafi",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 26.86,
              "until": 34.35
            },
            {
              "text": "Read the row you were taught, not all four",
